This is the Readme for:
Integral PI reduction

[Name]: Integral PI reduction
[Contact Person]: support-compss@bsc.es
[Access Level]: public
[License Agreement]: Apache2
[Platform]: COMPSs

[Body]
== Description ==
This application calculates the value of PI by integration with reduction.


== Execution instructions ==
Usage:
runcompss --lang=python src/integral_pi_reduction.py <num_steps> <num_batches>

where:
        * - num_steps: Number steps to divide the area
        * - num_batches: Number of groups of steps to be computed per task


== Execution Examples ==
runcompss --lang=python src/integral_pi_reduction.py 100000 10
runcompss src/integral_pi_reduction.py 100000 10
python -m pycompss src/integral_pi_reduction.py 100000 10


== Build ==
No build is required
